      <activity id="58766a1d-4622-502c-a7a7-0533afc49dad" activityNameId="8ae92f2f-a72d-525f-a0c9-8a21583f943e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, aluminium industry, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, aluminium industry, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: 20a8634b-9644-33b3-a3bc-15d530df605f
Included are the electricity production in European Aluminium Industry, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on UTCE data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_20a8634b-9644-33b3-a3bc-15d530df605f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
